    "description_raw": "Azata champions developed this spell to deal with fiends with\nunknown resistances. A ray of spiraling colors springs from\nyour hand and streaks to its target. You must make a successful\nranged touch attack to hit your target with the ray, which deals\n2d6 points of acid damage, 2d6 points of cold damage, 2d6\npoints of electricity damage, and 2d6 points of fire damage.\nThe type of energy that does the most points of damage to the\ntarget then persists, dealing another 4d6 points of that type of\ndamage per round for 1d4 rounds.",
